    thinkr:hasFitLevel thinkr:FitLevelType.Moderate ;
    skos:definition "Back leaders and groups who choose diplomacy over force where fuel routes and chokepoints invite escalation."@en ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.WWNSArchetypeMatrix ;
    skos:scopeNote "From the WWNS archetype matrix (cell: Disarmer x Energy Systems). Disarmer cells describe supporting those who do disarmament work, per the matrix."@en .

